Subject: [PATCH 4/5] stack_env: architect_critic carries its codified recipe
 env (DAR-LAT-3h, PROPOSED)

Applies only on gate G1 outcome R96 or R48. The live :8074 carries the
canonical OMP stack + GGML_IQK=1 and none of the recipe's GGML knobs, all of
which are compiled into production v10:
  GGML_NOHUGEPAGE_PROCESS=1  (CHAMP-2, operator-adopted 2026-09-08)
  GGML_FA_SPLIT_KV=0         (BE-2 row-exact decode/verify)
  GGML_FUSED_DECODE_OFF=1    (the recipe's graph path)

New test_stack_env_recipe_parity.py recomputes the registry's
server_mode.architect_critic.recipe.env from the compiled lean registry and
fails if the env start_server composes (strip included, see the previous
lane commit) does not carry it: the declared-never-read defect, SSU-F11.

Unsigned. Part of the DAR-LAT-3h stack-change package
(epyc-root artifacts/operator/stack-change-dar-lat-3h-20260926/).

